OL,3,ATinned goods and long-life milk boost
OL,4,Aretail sales after 'Be Ready' campaign
OL,5,Alaunch
OL,6,
OL,7,FRetail sales rose in October, driven by
OL,8,Fpeople buying long-life food such as
OL,9,Ftinned goods and UHT milk, according to
OL,10,Fofficial figures.
OL,12,FSales volumes were 0.7% higher as
OL,13,Fpeople responded to the government's
OL,14,Femergency preparedness "Be Ready"
OL,15,Fcampaign.
OL,17,FThis encouraged people to stock up in
OL,18,Fcase of disruption to essential
OL,19,Fservices by severe weather or
OL,20,Fcyberattacks.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
